# NeuralOps Testing & Verification Protocol

## Mandatory Test Execution Order

Tests must be executed strictly in the following sequence on the remote test runner:

1. `pytest tests/test_exhaustive_131_attentions_matrix.py -v` (1044 tests)
2. `pytest tests/test_exhaustive_72_compressors_matrix.py -v` (504 tests)
3. `pytest tests/test_exhaustive_26_triton_kernels_matrix.py -v` (68 tests)
4. `pytest tests/test_hnc_svd_exhaustive.py -v` (74 tests)
5. `pytest tests/ -q --ignore=tests/benchmarks` (full suite)

## Verification Reporting Standards

- **FORBIDDEN to claim "all tests pass" without raw output**: Unsubstantiated claims of success are strictly prohibited; raw execution logs must be presented.
- **FORBIDDEN to use `pytest.skip()` or `pytest.xfail()` to hide failures**: All test suites must resolve cleanly without artificial skips masking underlying defects.
